Favicon Error

Issue: Chrome Developer Tools displayed an HTTP 404 error because the browser requested a missing favicon.ico file.

Resolution: Added the following HTML inside the <head> section of index.html:

<link rel="icon" href="data:,">

Result: The browser stopped requesting the missing favicon, eliminating the unnecessary 404 error.

